        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:47.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The AI glasses have been integrated with the museum’s existing Grande Brera app, which includes an audio tour guide, developed by ANS for blind and low vision visitors.",
