        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When a visitor stands in front of one of eight selected artworks on the itinerary as part of this pilot, they can activate artwork recognition directly from the glasses and listen to the corresponding audio description through the open-ear speakers built into the frames.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/meta-milans-pinacoteca-di-brera-and-essilorluxottica-expand-access-to-art-through-ai-glasses/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
